# A River of Paper Lanterns
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
I tried drawing that river town.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
The lanterns look like stars.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
They are supposed to. You write a wish on the paper first.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
What would yours say?
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Ask me when we get there.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
She folds the drawing small enough to fit in your coat pocket.
